## 17. Model Limitations

This project is a machine-learning decision-support prototype.

The current development dataset is synthetic and therefore does not represent actual blood-bank operations.

The model should not replace:

* Blood-bank professionals
* Medical judgment
* Emergency protocols
* Operational inventory decisions

Before real-world deployment, the models would require validation and retraining using suitable real blood-bank or hospital data.

---

