---

## 19. Team Integration

The backend is designed to operate independently from the React frontend.

### Backend

```text
Python → XGBoost → FastAPI
```

### Frontend

```text
React → HTTP POST → FastAPI → Prediction → JSON Response
```

The frontend does not need to load or execute the XGBoost models directly. It only sends the required input features to the `/predict` endpoint and displays the returned prediction.

---

## 20. Project Disclaimer

This project is intended for educational and research purposes. The current model uses synthetic development data and has not been validated for clinical or real-world blood-bank use.
